  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sudan Displaced persons response due to conflic</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Project Goal and Long-term Outcomes:
a) These are found in the finalised project design and associated documents (see
project goal &amp; long-term outcomes are as follows:
2.2.1 IDPs are facing a shortage of accessing basic services and essential needs like 
water, food and NFIs. GBV is on the rise, as are mental health issues. Prices have 
increased dramatically for staple goods, fuel and transportation. Supporting the most 
vulnerable HHs and IDPs with cash assistance for food and NFIs is crucial to fill 
critical gaps. In WASH needs are acute in drinking water and sanitation</narrative>
  </description>
